cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this vocabulary, please cite it as below. There is no permanent DOI yet; one will be issued with the first non-draft release. The identifier listed is the Zenodo Sandbox test deposit of the version 5 draft."
type: dataset
title: "CGIAR Climate Adaptation and Mitigation Taxonomy"
version: "6.0.0-draft"
date-released: "2026-11-09"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Mlolita26/cgiar-climate-taxonomy"
url: "https://mlolita26.github.io/cgiar-climate-taxonomy/"
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5072/zenodo.607948"
    description: "Zenodo Sandbox test deposit of release v5.0.0-draft.1 (not a permanent DOI)"
abstract: "A controlled vocabulary of 768 concepts for describing climate adaptation and mitigation in agricultural research results, with definitions, synonyms, typed relations, and for each term its climate area, its tagging role (stand-alone or context-dependent) and the context in which it counts. Developed by the CGIAR MELIAF Climate Adaptation Activator."
keywords:
  - climate adaptation
  - climate mitigation
  - taxonomy
  - controlled vocabulary
  - SKOS
  - CGIAR
authors:
  - family-names: Nowak
    given-names: Andreea
    affiliation: "Alliance of Bioversity International and CIAT"
  - family-names: Muller
    given-names: Lolita
    affiliation: "Alliance of Bioversity International and CIAT"
